    year: 2011
    start: 74
    end: 79
    doi: "10.1109/ReConFig.2011.51"
    url: "https://doi.org/10.1109/ReConFig.2011.51"
    notes: >-
      This conference paper introduces DAMICORE, a method that groups
      similar software kernels so they can share a single FPGA hardware
      core, reducing hardware usage while maintaining comparable
      performance.

